          <p class="sub"><i>The Lover</i></p>
        </li>
        <li class="item">
          <p class="meta"><time>2025.08</time><span>성수아트홀</span></p>
          <h3><a href="https://www.beedoolkeetheatre.com/ko/productions/the-house-of-alba-(2025)" target="_blank" rel="noopener">〈알바의집, 배로나르다〉</a><span class="ext">↗</span></h3>
